WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.285
The hydraulic strip cutter and sliver sorter
convert peeled potatoes into graded raw strips.

00:00:06.355 --> 00:00:09.964
Select the machine before connecting the
simulated terminals.

00:00:10.174 --> 00:00:16.376
Connect cutter feed flow to AI04, then connect
DO04 to product feed enable.

00:00:16.446 --> 00:00:19.513
An enable command needs independent flow proof.

00:00:19.723 --> 00:00:22.785
Select an installed cutter pitch of 10
millimetres.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:27.511
In this exercise that is the accepted pitch, not
a range of blade sizes.

00:00:27.721 --> 00:00:29.830
Inject loss of feed-flow proof.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:35.017
Stop accepting potatoes into the cutting stream
until the input becomes valid again.

00:00:35.227 --> 00:00:40.299
Re-establish feed-flow proof, verify recovery
and release the graded strips.

00:00:40.369 --> 00:00:45.266
The worked lot removes 32.242 kilograms at this
stage.
